{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2022-09-01 07:30:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF SALE OF WEST VIRGINIA NATURAL GAS DISTRIBUTION COMPANY', 'text': "RICHMOND, VA. , SEPT. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOMINION ENERGY (NYSE: D) TODAY ANNOUNCED CLOSURE OF THE SALE OF ITS WEST VIRGINIA NATURAL GAS UTILITY – HOPE GAS, INC. (DOMINION ENERGY WEST VIRGINIA OR DEWV) – TO A SUBSIDIARY OF HEARTHSTONE HOLDINGS, INC., A PORTFOLIO COMPANY OF ULLICO INC.'S INFRASTRUCTURE FUND, FOR $690 MILLION, ADJUSTED FOR CUSTOMARY CLOSING ITEMS."}